=== HINT 1 ===
nullptr is a new keyword in C23.
Replace every NULL and 0 used as a pointer value with nullptr.

=== HINT 2 ===
There are three places to fix:
  1. n->next = nullptr;
  2. Node *head = nullptr;
  3. head = nullptr;

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
Line "n->next  = NULL;"   → n->next  = nullptr;
Line "Node *head = NULL;" → Node *head = nullptr;
Line "head = 0;"          → head = nullptr;
